  "description": "POBFUJ crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C62 H72 N12 O28 Tb6 4+,4(C1 H4 O1),10(H2 O1),4(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb1 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb5 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb6 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 9 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.648-4.007 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 96.95-113.46°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C66H108Cl4Tb6N12O42. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
